w/ errors, haven't tested pre-4.2.2), **4.4-beta3** (slow but no errors)\n- Reproducible both in Windows and Linux\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Windows 10.0.22631 - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - AMD Ryzen 7 7700X 8-Core Processor (16 Threads), but also happens on Linux!\n\n### Issue description\n\nFont reimporting is slow (and spits out errors before 4.4) when the font in question is set as the project default font (project setting `gui/theme/custom_font`).\n\nErrors (1024+ of these repeating):\n```\nmodules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp:2608 - Parameter \"fd\" is null.\nmodules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp:2464 - Parameter \"fd\" is null.\nmodules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp:2640 - Parameter \"fd\" is null.\n```\nNOTE: The error messages don't seem to appear in 4.4 (tested beta 3), but the slow import remains!\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the MRP. If the issue doesn't show itself with the following steps, close the project and try again (I've seen it not happen on initial project import).\n\n1. Open scene `test.tscn` (not necessary, but has these steps written in UI)\n2. Note: Project default theme is set to use custom font **\"Not Jam UI\"**.\n3. Try reimporting font **\"joystix\"**, happens quickly\n4. Try reimporting font **\"Not Jam UI\"**, is slow and spits out errors pre-4.4\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[FontBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18723721/FontBug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_